---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
import headshot from "../assets/alexander-colwell-headshot.jpg";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Alexander S. Colwell"
  description={`Meet ${site.attorneyName}, attorney and CPA at ${site.firmName}, focused on wills, trusts, and powers of attorney.`}
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-gold-700 uppercase">About</p>
    <h1 class="font-display mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold text-navy-900">{site.attorneyName}</h1>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[280px_1fr] md:gap-14">
      <div>
        <Image
          src={headshot}
          alt={`Portrait of ${site.attorneyFirstLast}`}
          width={560}
          height={560}
          class="aspect-square w-full rounded-sm border border-navy-900/10 object-cover shadow-sm"
        />
        <div class="mt-6 rounded-sm border border-navy-900/10 bg-cream-200 p-5">
          <h2 class="font-display text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-navy-900 uppercase">Contact</h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-ink-700">
            <li><a href={site.phoneHref} class="hover:text-gold-700">{site.phone}</a></li>
            <li><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="hover:text-gold-700">{site.email}</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prose-legal max-w-2xl text-ink-700">
        <p class="text-lg">
          {site.attorneyName} founded {site.firmName} to give individuals and families in
          Wisconsin a straightforward, personal approach to estate planning — one built on the
          belief that a good plan should be as much about your family's peace of mind as it is
          about the paperwork.
        </p>
        <h2>A dual perspective: attorney and CPA</h2>
        <p>
          What sets Alexander apart is a background that combines legal training with a
          Certified Public Accountant's eye for the financial details. Estate plans don't just
          need to be legally valid — they need to make sense with your taxes, your accounts, and
          how your assets are actually titled. That combination lets Alexander catch issues that a
          purely legal (or purely financial) review might miss.
        </p>
        <h2>A personal approach</h2>
        <p>
          Every family's situation is different, and estate planning documents drafted from a
          generic template rarely fit well. Alexander takes the time to understand your goals —
          for your spouse, your children, your business, or your care as you age — before
          recommending a plan built around them.
        </p>
        <h2>Credentials</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Licensed Attorney (Esq.)</li>
          <li>Certified Public Accountant (CPA)</li>
          <li>Focused on Wills, Trusts, and Powers of Attorney</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-500">
          Have specific questions about your background you'd like added here — law school,
          admissions, bar memberships, prior experience, community involvement? Send them over and
          this section will be updated.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 rounded-sm bg-navy-900 px-8 py-10 text-center text-cream-100">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold">Schedule a consultation with Alexander</h2>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <a href={site.phoneHref} class="rounded-sm bg-gold-500 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-navy-950 hover:bg-gold-400">
          Call {site.phone}
        </a>
        <a href="/contact/" class="rounded-sm border border-cream-100/30 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-cream-100 hover:border-cream-100/60">
          Send a Message
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
